            'nav.exphw': ['Hardware CSV', 'Downloads the hardware inventory of all devices: group, host name, OS and one row per component (CPU, GPU, memory banks, disks, BIOS, motherboard, chassis, TPM, network). UTF-8 with BOM, formulas neutralised, sorted so a device block stays together.'],
